firebase-android-sdk (https://github.com/firebase/firebase-android-sdk)
Copyright Google LLC
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The Gradle plugin in sdk/android/aruma-storage-gradle (dev.aruma.storage)
modifies firebase-storage for Android (com.google.firebase:firebase-storage)
inside each app it builds: it replaces the text
"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0" in the static initializer of
com.google.firebase.storage.network.NetworkRequest with the Aruma server's
base URL, and changes nothing else. No firebase-storage code is included in
this repository. Every app built with the plugin carries a notice of the
change in META-INF/aruma/firebase-storage-MODIFIED.txt.
